reveal style="--reveal-delay: 60ms" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>RSM132-8-720-745BHDG</h1> <p class="t-lede" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 120ms" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>The Hyper-ion Pro flagship — heterojunction cell technology at up to 745 W and 24.0% efficiency, with at least 90% of rated output still guaranteed at year 30.</p> <dl class="hero-stats" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 180ms" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <div class="stat" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>720–745</dd> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Watts peak</dt> </div><div class="stat" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>24.0%</dd> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Max efficiency</dt> </div><div class="stat" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>≥90%</dd> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Output at year 30</dt> </div><div class="stat" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>−0.24%/°C</dd> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Temp coefficient (Pmax)</dt> </div> </dl> <div class="ctas" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 240ms" data-product-docs data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <a href="/downloads/datasheets/RSM132-8-720-745BHDG-Hyper-ion-Pro-datasheet-2026H1-EN.pdf" class="btn btn-ghost btn-doc" download data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <svg class="btn-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <path d="M12 3v12" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf></path><path d="M7 11l5 5 5-5" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf></path><path d="M5 21h14" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf></path> </svg> Download datasheet </a>  <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-accent" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Enquire about this product</a> </div> </header> <div class="visual" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 150ms" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <img src="/_astro/front.x1BH5SMS_1usGEU.webp" srcset="/_astro/front.x1BH5SMS_1usGEU.webp 1x, /_astro/front.x1BH5SMS_gILEB.webp 2x" alt="RSM132-8-720-745BHDG front view" loading="eager" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf="true" decoding="async" width="880" height="1581"> </div> </div> </div> <div class="container" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <section class="highlights" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <h2 class="t-micro group-label" data-reveal data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Why this product</h2> <ul role="list" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <li data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 0ms" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>n-type HJT (heterojunction) cells — Risen&#39;s premium cell platform, first to mass-produce 0BB and ultra-thin HJT cells</li><li data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 60ms" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Bifacial factor 90±5% — rear-side gain of up to 30% depending on installation and albedo</li><li data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 120ms" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Just 0.3% annual degradation: at least 90% of rated power guaranteed after 30 years</li><li data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 180ms" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Outstanding temperature behaviour (−0.24%/°C Pmax) for hot Australian conditions</li><li data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 240ms" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Ultra-low carbon footprint: under 376.5 kg CO₂eq/kWc — strong ESG credentials for project procurement</li><li data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 300ms" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Available in aluminium or steel frame variants</li> </ul> </section> <section class="gallery" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <figure data-reveal data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <div class="frame" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf><img src="/_astro/back.CRrEiiRf_X79vq.webp" alt="RSM132-8-720-745BHDG rear view" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="640" height="1152"></div> <figcaption class="t-micro" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Rear view</figcaption> </figure> <figure data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 90ms" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <div class="frame" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf><img src="/_astro/side.CEIWRO5-_9mkJF.webp" alt="RSM132-8-720-745BHDG side profile" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="640" height="357"></div> <figcaption class="t-micro" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Side profile</figcaption> </figure> </section> <section class="video-block" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <h2 class="t-micro group-label" data-reveal data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>See it in action</h2> <video controls preload="metadata" poster="/videos/hyper-ion-pro-global-cases-poster.jpg" data-reveal data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <source src="/videos/hyper-ion-pro-global-cases.mp4" type="video/mp4" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> </video> </section>  <section class="specs" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <div class="spec-group" data-reveal data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <h2 class="t-micro group-label" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Electrical</h2> <dl data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Module power</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>720 – 745 Wp</dd> </div><div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Module efficiency</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>up to 24.0%</dd> </div><div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Bifacial factor</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>90 ± 5%</dd> </div><div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Max system voltage</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>1500 VDC</dd> </div> </dl> </div><div class="spec-group" data-reveal data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <h2 class="t-micro group-label" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Mechanical</h2> <dl data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Cell technology</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>n-type HJT, 132 cells (6×11 + 6×11)</dd> </div><div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Dimensions</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>2384 × 1303 × 33 mm</dd> </div><div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Weight</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>37.5 kg</dd> </div><div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Frame</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Aluminium alloy (steel frame variant available)</dd> </div> </dl> </div><div class="spec-group" data-reveal data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <h2 class="t-micro group-label" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Temperature</h2> <dl data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Temperature coefficient (Pmax)</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>−0.24%/°C</dd> </div><div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Temperature coefficient (Voc)</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>−0.22%/°C</dd> </div> </dl> </div><div class="spec-group" data-reveal data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <h2 class="t-micro group-label" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Warranty &amp; sustainability</h2> <dl data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Product warranty</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>15 years</dd> </div><div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Performance warranty</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>30 years · ≥90% of rated output at year 30</dd> </div><div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>First-year / annual degradation</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>≤1% / 0.3%</dd> </div><div class="row" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf> <dt data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>Carbon footprint</dt> <dd data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>&lt; 376.5 kg CO₂eq/kWc</dd> </div> </dl> </div> <p class="fine" data-astro-cid-7xojfyaf>
Specifications from official Risen documentation. Always confirm against the
          current datasheet before specifying.
